                <syl /><neume facs="#m-111571de-a1df-4064-9d85-c6296d41212e" type="clivis" xml:id="m-ceae5245-6738-43de-9878-c3ffe3f25786">
                  <nc xml:id="m-0883e250-caf1-4a6a-b7ba-91b8319479c4" pname="b" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-30f91734-a5e1-43b8-aeac-670d6c5602d5" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-1318fccb-6184-44c1-aa95-f59e90482e34">
            <lg xml:id="m-50a168a1-466e-4d41-ba62-c86fcc75affd">
              <l xml:id="m-a353e718-1bed-45d2-80bc-5bf9aeb20aaf" facs="#m-e13c792b-0398-47d8-b84e-bf4c8fb2c09e" label="ambiguous">March 24</l><l xml:id="m-6a7003bc-54df-43a4-a5de-ca068dc2e7d8" facs="#m-c9eee4c8-12d5-4943-b365-084e25fbb504" label="ambiguous">1411</l><l xml:id="m-e048c2f4-2808-40e7-bd9e-6f95cf35df94" facs="#m-0c6590dc-1900-4863-8c74-458946621aab" label="lyrics-like">xit fl-li: Ab exórdi-o précum tu-árum egréssus est sér¬</l><l xml:id="m-f26955f1-6075-4f9a-8eb9-edb17b07a9dc" facs="#m-555b67e1-d3be-4dcd-9fc3-4135f6e21fc7" label="lyrics-like">mo; égo autem vé¬ ni ut indi-câ-rem tí-bi: tu ergo</l><l xml:id="m-e2142913-327b-4d67-a662-842d1a33f731" facs="#m-be59ee45-c1bb-4463-88c2-ae1b226d4b81" label="lyrics-like">animadvérte sermónem, et intélli-ge vi-si-ônem.</l><l xml:id="m-b5546437-afec-409b-b74d-0b422332a9ce" facs="#m-f21480dd-3ee4-4763-8834-4d7cff144387" label="ambiguous">E u ou a e.</l><l xml:id="m-58afbe92-5f75-4086-9a7e-49e7db875eda" facs="#m-e7973556-288b-4b07-8b05-207b1dd26453" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 7. a. p. 211. — Prayer. Deus, qui. as below.</l><l xml:id="m-16003b1d-11eb-485d-9204-d0c53e8de102" facs="#m-9c4db2fa-a4bb-4056-b139-dfc90d56f90a" label="text-like">Commemoration of the Ferid, p. 1080.</l><l xml:id="m-fb681eab-6cdd-4e26-8c76-d15391e34983" facs="#m-d1fa5a89-c3c3-4915-a87d-25d33f018484" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-7759e7a8-1e46-4a5a-b955-13dfffd33c34" facs="#m-fa1941b0-30ab-4a50-b93f-d2e1f6ae9bc7" label="text-like">Introit. Gradual. Offertory (without Alleluia), and Communion as on</l><l xml:id="m-181494c6-d473-444d-be8d-4914fa42d3d6" facs="#m-5eb4641d-ae07-4da8-9caa-b297cf9b6633" label="ambiguous">September 29, p. 1658.</l><l xml:id="m-7a0bdfb6-55c8-43b1-9ed6-e90a2a667802" facs="#m-de8fa5a5-9b20-45cd-85ec-dc867a2c278d" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-22170cd1-9278-4995-b64a-27edb0147b59" facs="#m-190e1c70-6c7a-49b3-9b42-e25788e93e49" label="lyrics-like">AEus, qui inter céteros Angelos, tius; ut, qui festum ejus celebrá¬</l><l xml:id="m-18354617-5449-4a18-bdb1-19c166c02cca" facs="#m-f68761bc-5765-464d-bc98-e63838c3e06d" label="lyrics-like">ad annuntiándum incarnatiónis! mus in terris, * ipsius patrocinium</l><l xml:id="m-08a71cf8-cbd1-496b-8884-9c7ad2bd1238" facs="#m-a6a42ef4-d5e0-450d-967d-40087d82c57d" label="lyrics-like">tuae mystérium, Gabriélem Archán-Isentiámus in caelis: Qui vivis et</l><l xml:id="m-4263d88a-2558-44e4-9876-d192949fd173" facs="#m-71129db6-7ea0-4cce-9556-f8336d4a1982" label="lyrics-like">gelum elegísti: t concéde propi-Tregnas.</l><l xml:id="m-1ec0a567-3d61-461c-aae3-c7309bee84fb" facs="#m-cca7aaea-9285-4723-b359-fcf95e31cdf6" label="ambiguous">Lectio Danielis Prophetae. Dan. 9. f.</l><l xml:id="m-25f51589-7901-4144-82f2-1aef362f65d1" facs="#m-2cda0a29-9ff0-43a4-bce7-6a3269b731c5" label="lyrics-like">IN diébus illis: Ecce vir Gábriel, l quitas, et adducátur justitia sempi¬</l><l xml:id="m-3af7944d-5332-4806-b098-6ca6925813a1" facs="#m-62fe24bf-2a36-42f2-8f65-eb43f1a14efd" label="lyrics-like">L quem víderam in visióne a prin¬</l><l xml:id="m-314484f3-9f8d-4870-b9a4-a6e79640069b" facs="#m-e6594a0d-b9a3-4d02-81ed-fc9d1f7dfa75" label="lyrics-like">térna, et impleátur vísio, et pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-bbad77e8-4a46-405b-8b4d-a5ccf7a4be13" facs="#m-32536644-28ff-455a-8fe5-8469c5213b7d" label="lyrics-like">phetía, et ungátur Sanctus sanctó¬</l><l xml:id="m-d0e2da5a-b03b-401c-8b3f-a3f93a2d7742" facs="#m-b517f304-d361-4abe-a556-73892a108e7b" label="lyrics-like">cipio, cito volans tétigit me in</l><l xml:id="m-5c47702f-f436-479a-9630-098400547086" facs="#m-b08d8fc7-4d3e-42da-b43d-0fa9dbe2fd61" label="lyrics-like">témpore sacrifícii vespertíni. Et rum. Scito ergo, et animadvérte:</l><l xml:id="m-d32402ac-591a-4aea-a8c7-966c287cd406" facs="#m-00814d14-962b-4b74-9b86-c24371966e1b" label="lyrics-like">Ab éxitu sermónis, ut iterum aedi¬</l><l xml:id="m-78fa17af-0798-47c7-ac3a-929d8e2ce6a1" facs="#m-83e70d12-6553-4019-897b-cddf9cb05790" label="lyrics-like">dócuit me. et locútus est mihi,</l><l xml:id="m-fe5f4d6a-09c7-4c46-b2f4-273017021418" facs="#m-984e629f-3831-4096-90e4-c998ed8eae06" label="lyrics-like">dixitque: Dániel, nunc egréssus ficétur Jerúsalem, usque ad Chri¬</l><l xml:id="m-4e6c7795-da02-4fd3-999c-74e389696f42" facs="#m-c4f25cfd-d2bf-4195-80df-258e32e05886" label="lyrics-like">sum ut docérem te, et intelligeres.</l><l xml:id="m-741aa8cb-04c4-4cbf-8061-8d69e87d3764" facs="#m-427c3f73-f774-410d-8cbe-f8e8465ba1b5" label="lyrics-like">stum ducem, hebdómades septem,</l><l xml:id="m-fe5faf47-f8a0-453a-b600-e8aa54fcc501" facs="#m-369ab38f-8890-4884-b180-f8b24e9ebab5" label="lyrics-like">Ab exórdio precum tuárum egrés¬</l><l xml:id="m-af3c4f5e-5cbb-4e8e-99e6-00954e33ce46" facs="#m-b282af64-4df0-465e-97b1-6a16938490e3" label="lyrics-like">et hebdómades sexagínta duae</l><l xml:id="m-c6232df6-87e7-4976-9071-e76edf163b9c" facs="#m-2a2e30df-cda6-4bd6-88e7-e1da54638bea" label="lyrics-like">sus est sermo: ego autem veni utl erunt: et rursum aedificábitur pla¬</l><l xml:id="m-e5213d06-1c1c-4886-acb5-778eef3738f7" facs="#m-c9fd9a11-5b0e-45fb-af1d-f60b886fda2e" label="lyrics-like">indicárem tibi, quia vir deside¬</l><l xml:id="m-8aa02fcc-bb55-4559-804b-e79d70c39d9a" facs="#m-7b45c584-46ec-4e34-ab75-4a7cffeddec9" label="lyrics-like">téa et muri in angústia témporum.</l><l xml:id="m-5f3e63ae-5842-4255-8922-0a9270efd607" facs="#m-2c677482-3ded-46e8-af4c-8e87586258ab" label="lyrics-like">riórum es: tu ergo animadvérte</l><l xml:id="m-a8146220-f680-442a-aa96-c6811338733f" facs="#m-91c21c6a-e815-400c-b82b-8d30050e247d" label="lyrics-like">Et post hebdómades sexaginta duas</l><l xml:id="m-6b190ef3-5719-4836-a301-5c302f292493" facs="#m-8992e260-843e-4475-9753-f7984a410f6b" label="lyrics-like">sermónem, et intéllige visiónem.</l><l xml:id="m-9bb8b93c-871c-4d91-8e90-2df6f6ea069f" facs="#m-f9dbda36-ccd7-4c19-b9c4-9c69a0e7ce0f" label="lyrics-like">occidétur Christus : et non erit ejus</l><l xml:id="m-21272f03-cb69-4b79-bbba-c5ab09284b43" facs="#m-5352a446-ffe8-4720-99b3-8e9699ce091f" label="lyrics-like">Septuaginta hebdómades abbre¬</l><l xml:id="m-38adf05d-d90d-4b3d-ba54-3f91b40d2540" facs="#m-44857bcc-9a5e-42a8-8c8d-95b033960e90" label="lyrics-like">pópulus, qui eum negatúrus est. Et</l><l xml:id="m-dd7d4ef0-15ae-44a3-ac26-e73cbbd0cee8" facs="#m-1c6c6ddb-8d6f-47fd-9075-f5a7285c5d73" label="lyrics-like">civitátem, et sanctuárium dissipábit</l><l xml:id="m-7e80e906-7f8a-4744-be56-f4fc7ea11b17" facs="#m-3b0cd660-f88d-4c50-ace1-7c5249eb7c2c" label="lyrics-like">viátae sunt super pópulum tuum, et</l><l xml:id="m-8e55a2f7-4139-44c8-9120-3e8d618f2c03" facs="#m-b612a135-471f-43ff-b824-f34a40839fe5" label="lyrics-like">super urbem sanctam tuam ut con-pópulus cum duce ventúro: et finis</l><l xml:id="m-4e5eb4bc-bc81-4c97-972e-b2153896ecaf" facs="#m-e66058c2-7a76-44e2-b439-2620915c900c" label="lyrics-like">summétur praevaricátio, et finem lejus vástitas, et post finem belli</l><l xml:id="m-4a2b82e1-3568-40ba-9540-e6746f3e051b" facs="#m-9c28e97b-be49-48e9-a8cc-30a98dd46607" label="lyrics-like">accipiat peccátum, et deleátur ini-lstatúta desolátio.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>